title: Documentation
kind: overview
summary: The entry point of the metafolder documentation.

metafolder keeps metadata about files — and about things that are not files —
as ''metarecords'' in per-directory repositories, served by a daemon and used
through the `mf` command line and a desktop GUI.

!! Topics

* [[Duplicates]] — finding byte-identical files and deleting the copies you choose
* [[Trash]] — the per-repository bin: trashing, restoring, undoing

!! Catalogs

Every item of these lists exists in the code; the lists are complete.

* [[CLI command]] — every `mf` command
* [[GUI command]] — every command of the GUI's command input
* [[Panel]] — every panel type of the GUI
* [[Shipped script]] — the helper scripts installed with the configuration
